      "role": "user",
      "content": "right. so it's basically a gray area. if i'm working on a lot of similar fintech projects, the lines get really blurry. i guess i'm mostly worried about them trying to claim ownership over my general expertise or \"know-how\" if it looks too similar to what they had. is there any way to protect myself in the contract itself, like adding a specific list of what i consider my own pre-existing tools or patterns?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
