      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You can protect yourself by insisting on a precise definition of \"unaided memory,\" ensuring it explicitly excludes \"pre-existing general industry knowledge,\" \"publicly available libraries,\" and \"skills acquired through independent education.\" Attempting to carve out exceptions like copyrighted algorithms or open-source tools within the NDA itself is a viable strategy, but it requires drafting clear boundaries that distinguish your innate expertise from the specific confidential data passed to you. However, be aware that many Fintech NDAs deliberately omit such definitions precisely to hold high-level technical concepts hostage, making it nearly impossible to negotiate these specifics security without risking contract rejection.",
